# the disappearing code forge

our code forge disappears because the web view is statically generated
	pgit
		git web viewer
	git-pr
		patch requests
		issue tracker
	ci status
		test and build pipelines

the only thing we host are bare git repos
	we install some git hooks that send pipe events

make it easy to collaborate on coding projects
	make it easy to track issues and discussions
	make it easy to submit code changes
	make it easy to review code changes
	make it easy to upstream code changes

make it easy to view code in the browser
	make it easy to maintain

make it easy to run ci pipelines

